msgstr "Réglages"

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/welcome.rs:84
msgid "Tuning holds what every game gets: Gamescope, Wine FSR, vkBasalt, lsfg-vk and MangoHud. Two technologies that collide are never left on together without asking you."
msgstr "Réglages contient ce que reçoit chaque jeu : Gamescope, Wine FSR, vkBasalt, lsfg-vk et MangoHud. Deux technologies qui entrent en conflit ne sont jamais laissées actives ensemble sans vous demander."

#: bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/profile_offer.rs:250 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/overview.rs:31 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/performance.rs:36 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/details/problems.rs:191 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/home.rs:1066 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/home.rs:896 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/views/home.rs:905 bigame-engine/bigame-ui/src/widgets/tutorial.rs:183
msgid "Turbo"
